#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/what_is.rst:5
msgid "What is the element editor?"
msgstr "元素编辑器是什么?"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/what_is.rst:7
msgid ""
"The element editor is the editor provided by QElectroTech to modify existing"
" element from the user collection and create new elements to the collection."
msgstr "元素编辑器是QElectroTech提供的编辑器，用于修改用户收藏中的现有元素，并创建新元素到收藏中。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/what_is.rst:10
msgid ""
"The element editor is displayed as a PopUp window and looks like the figure "
"below."
msgstr "元素编辑器作为弹出窗口显示，外观类似下图。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/what_is.rst:15
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech element editor"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 元素编辑器"
